% path_sandbox — keep agent paths inside the repository

# Module: path-sandbox

Create pure path-decision helpers `resolveSandboxPath` and `isInsideSandbox`.
Reject traversal outside root, outside absolute paths, prefix lookalikes, null
bytes, home syntax, and symlinks whose existing ancestor lands outside root.
Accept normalized and not-yet-created paths that remain inside. Resolve the
longest existing ancestor so `escape/new-file` cannot bypass a symlink check.
Return a canonical absolute path. Only filesystem metadata needed for path
resolution may be read; never open file contents.
